import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 326 | Perfect-World Inevitable Historical Regression: Civilization Breaks Generations After Shi Hao","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 326 | Perfect-World Inevitable Historical Regression: Civilization Breaks Generations After Shi Hao","no":326,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Shi Hao","Historical Regression","Generational Break","Single-Handed Autocracy"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","26-Individual-Collective Balance Principle","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0326_模块2-完美世界-石昊之后文明即断代.md","filePath":"en/0326_模块2-完美世界-石昊之后文明即断代.md"}'),o={name:"en/0326_模块2-完美世界-石昊之后文明即断代.md"};function r(s,e,l,d,c,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-326-perfect-world-inevitable-historical-regression-civilization-breaks-generations-after-shi-hao" tabindex="-1">Entry 326 | Perfect-World Inevitable Historical Regression: Civilization Breaks Generations After Shi Hao <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-326-perfect-world-inevitable-historical-regression-civilization-breaks-generations-after-shi-hao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 326 | Perfect-World Inevitable Historical Regression: Civilization Breaks Generations After Shi Hao&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-World Full Decomposition (Entry 3) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 26, 21</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-price-of-single-handedly-deciding-eternity-is-no-successor-after-eternity" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The price of single-handedly deciding eternity is no successor after eternity <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-price-of-single-handedly-deciding-eternity-is-no-successor-after-eternity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The price of single-handedly deciding eternity is no successor after eternity&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The four characters &quot;single-handedly decide eternity&quot; read heroically; what Heng Yuan Zhou reads is a sigh. Shi Hao blocked darkness for the later Shrouding era, but did not leave later generations a force that can night-watch on its own. This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — to argue: Perfect World&#39;s historical regression is not accident, but the inevitable product of single-log structure. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The generational-break problem is essentially failure of energy precipitation:</p><ul><li>Shi Hao poured all energy into &quot;holding darkness now,&quot; leaving no energy to build &quot;tomorrow&#39;s night watchmen&quot;</li><li>Self-seed cannot be replicated, equivalent to taking the most precious evolution path away with the person</li><li>Shrouding era&#39;s emperors must grope from zero for the same kind of darkness, energy paid repeatedly</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This entry&#39;s core, argued in three layers:</p><ol><li><strong>Inheritance layer broken</strong>: single-log civilization&#39;s highest achievement rests on one person. Shi Hao exits; highest combat power, highest cognition, highest night-watch responsibility simultaneously hang. Shrouding era still needs &quot;one emperor suppresses one era,&quot; proving the solution was never institutionalized</li><li><strong>Knowledge layer broken</strong>: the path of single-handedly deciding eternity, the final cognition of the dark source, not Alaya-archived, not opened via teaching systems. Later generations can only guess from legends; knowledge compound interest zeroed</li><li><strong>Confidence layer broken</strong>: Myriad Ranks long-term protected, losing the training to &quot;solve darkness themselves.&quot; Darkness arrives, first reaction is still &quot;wait for the next Desolate,&quot; not starting its own immunity</li></ol><p>Conclusion: the more successful the single-handed autocracy over eternity, the more thorough the generational break — because Myriad Ranks were even deprived by Shi Hao&#39;s strength of the chance to &quot;learn to carry it themselves.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao&#39;s &quot;solitude&quot; structurally takes civilization&#39;s sovereignty as well:</p><ul><li>He made all major decisions and fights for Myriad Ranks</li><li>Myriad Ranks thereby lost civilization-subject qualification, degenerated into the protected</li><li>This &quot;gentle takeover&quot; makes Myriad Ranks immediately regress to savagery in his absence</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Perfect World Generational-Break Risk</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Single-handedly deciding eternity, one person carries</td><td>Anchor Council collective governance, responsibility dispersed</td></tr><tr><td>Path non-replicable</td><td>300 systems all-tier public, teachable and learnable</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad Ranks protected</td><td>Myriad Ranks republican co-build, everyone is a night watchman</td></tr><tr><td>Exit = darkness returns</td><td>Law precedes, order written into charter</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate post-Shi-Hao-exit era parameters</li><li>Inject two cases — &quot;no institutional precipitation&quot; vs. &quot;institutional precipitation present&quot;</li><li>Count later generations&#39; cost of responding to the same kind of darkness</li><li>Output &quot;Perfect World Generational-Break Cost Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Multi-era handoffs rely on timeline patches; generational-break logic stitched with vague concepts like &quot;samsara,&quot; &quot;weirdness&quot;</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Shrouding, Sacred Ruins repeatedly revise Perfect World&#39;s ending</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: the generational-break cost can also be converted into repeated tuition. Shi Hao paid it in ancient times, Ye Fan paid it again in later generations, the Sacred Ruins era paid it a third time — the same hard problem of how to respond to darkness is repeatedly answered by civilization with three person-level epics, yet no one ever wrote the standard answer into a textbook. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alaya Network is precisely the opposite: one generation&#39;s experience is immediately archived; later generations only retrieve, need not re-examine. Generational break is not literary tragedy, but the most expensive kind of repetition in civilization economics.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: energy not precipitated into inheritable institutions</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: single-handed autocracy essentially takes over Myriad Ranks&#39; sovereignty</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least left the Peerless Academy; Shi Hao did not even leave a replicable night-watch institution</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks protected-ized, losing evolution-subject qualification</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: generational-break civilization cannot export stable order to the multiverse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-network-deduction-of-generational-break-crisis" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Network Deduction of Generational-Break Crisis <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-network-deduction-of-generational-break-crisis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Network Deduction of Generational-Break Crisis&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The inevitability that civilization breaks generations after Shi Hao has been repeatedly verified through Alaya Network&#39;s Quest Sediment Domain simulation. Why Heng Yuan Zhou can avoid this outcome is that the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization ties civilization&#39;s survival to the network, not individuals — the law-first axiom ensures institutions do not stop rotating due to any individual&#39;s absence. The universal equal infinite law means civilization&#39;s foundation is 99% of Myriad-Rank beings, not some Emperor Immortal. In Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s view, Shi Hao&#39;s single-handed autocracy over eternity is tragedy, not hero narrative: a true strong one should let civilization continue forward behind him, not tie civilization to himself.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The other side of single-handedly deciding eternity is that no one can succeed for eternity. Heng Yuan Zhou does not celebrate &quot;one person holding everything,&quot; but pursues &quot;no one needs to hold everything alone.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · civilization breaks generations after Shi Hao described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./325_模块2-完美世界-仙帝级资质用于独断万古.html">Entry 325 · Energy-Level Waste</a> · <a href="./352_模块2-完美世界-石昊缺位后的文明崩溃模拟.html">Entry 352 · Quest Sediment Domain Review</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">26-Individual-Collective Balance Principle</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const y=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,y as default};
